cpgrams.body:
Ministry: Ministry of Labour and Employment → Employees' Provident Fund Organisation

Subject: EPFiGMS grievance {grievance_no} unresolved – PF claim {claim_id} pending since {filed_date}

I, {name} (UAN {uan}), filed a {claim_type} claim (Claim ID {claim_id}) on {filed_date}. {status_sentence}

I raised EPFiGMS grievance {grievance_no} on {grievance_date}, but it has not been resolved. {problem_sentence}

