{name}
Mobile: {mobile}

rti.body:
To,
The Central Public Information Officer,
Employees' Provident Fund Organisation, Regional Office {regional_office}

Subject: Information under Section 6(1) of the RTI Act, 2005 regarding PF claim {claim_id}

I, {name} (UAN {uan}), filed a {claim_type} claim (Claim ID {claim_id}) on {filed_date}. Despite grievance(s) {grievance_no}, it remains unresolved.

Please provide the following information:
1. The current status of Claim ID {claim_id} and the date on which it was last acted upon.
2. The specific reason(s) for its rejection/pendency, with a copy of the relevant file notings.
3. The rule, circular or document relied upon for the rejection.
4. The name and designation of the officer(s) who processed the claim.
5. The specific correction or document required from me to settle the claim.

I am paying the prescribed fee of ₹10. I request the information within 30 days as required under Section 7(1) of the RTI Act.

{name}
{address}
Mobile: {mobile}
Date: {today}

